-sGC1201片剂每日一次口服，低/中/高三个剂量水平，双盲双模拟，治疗期12周，联合标准GDMT背景治疗。","quote_sha256":"2953a2101a19642c6041959f1937d4b942ca0d27212d91a97c73872cbd2fd257","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_015"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂平行对照：外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次，给药与访视安排同试验组，联合相同GDMT背景，按1:1:1:1随机分配。","quote_sha256":"f1f6aff7a4ebd367dd14c0174b7a455eac32886b24c3d7578ef76ccbfce93fc4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_016"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"分配模型：平行组","quote_sha256":"5e70b0bc5b3a55e709991ab54941ee36f3a7e04e4d8d776ac74298515efc5ab1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_017"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_018"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"自适应设计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"c71bda4d6101542f8a3c2bb0087631982c72176be9ca9a2526dc2c08ed0ee52a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_019"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"913a62236e4f4332a7188562f2625d53aa7f770cea155664564c5fb821a98efd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_020"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"31ef70e7f5cd03d6c17b90802e7352c6e81b5fdc853989b74ea1499901f514a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_021"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"SRC是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"c313c8ef9ed6e2107818bc5d2c8caa143c85bf55ac51060b4e8cc53c959daf6e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_022"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"DMC是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"7463c7eb67cd6a318d836f289e02648d5296c8dfe0b2f415f8f2bed6e14be4a2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_023"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"研究分期：II期","quote_sha256":"0cd03d3b6552ef4d709f859513123058d34ed8e8f0e5ae9b9b7e718967255947","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_028"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"开发区域：中国","quote_sha256":"cff843d358ea50e7e53ede8d1eba9b9d23baa740d2cd2134679e6483c3e50b76","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_029"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_004","es_006","es_008","es_009","es_010","es_011","es_015","es_016","es_017","es_018","es_019","es_020","es_021","es_022","es_023","es_028","es_029"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":17},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为II期概念验证与剂量探索临床研究，采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计。研究在中国境内开展，共设四个平行组：KZ-sGC1201低剂量组（2.5 mg每日一次）、中剂量组（5 mg每日一次）、高剂量组（10 mg每日一次）及安慰剂对照组，各组按1:1:1:1比例随机分配。每组计划入组约60例，总样本量约240例，基于NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量与80%把握度估算，用于概念验证与剂量选择。所有受试者在标准GDMT背景治疗基础上接受试验药或安慰剂，治疗期12周。研究采用双盲双模拟设计，安慰剂为外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次给药，给药与访视安排同试验组。研究不设置自适应设计、样本量再估计、期中分析、SRC或DMC。估计目标策略为治疗策略（treatment policy），无论是否发生剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组进行分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势，安全性采用描述统计，次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","rationale":"设计要素（随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心、1:1:1:1分配、三剂量加安慰剂、12周治疗期、双盲双模拟、FAS、ANCOVA、治疗策略估计目标、无自适应、无期中分析、无DMC）均直接来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。样本量约240例及估算依据亦为已确认事实。开发区域为中国。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标、剂量选择、期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_4e9f04592c63_cc46d60c594f429e","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:05ef1b858d770a033939e939","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261007202139_90d3677c","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_4e9f04592c63_2c493b849da84a70:full-draft:05ef1b858d770a033939e939","quote":"随机化；双盲；安慰剂对照；平行组；多中心","quote_sha256":"2390eec78cb63fbb744f4d0cd34ca9e3a52cae7420fe7f7e88f4c2d12a283514","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:05ef1b858d770a033939e939","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心；II期概念验证+剂量探索，KZ-sGC1201三个剂量组与安慰剂对照，治疗12周","quote_sha256":"b819de46aec5faba00a57e77ffd9509fb27fd23963bed62423f3911f9b6ed308","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（第-28至-1天）；12周双盲治疗期（第0天随机给药至第12周）；治疗结束访视（第12周±3天）；安全随访期（末次给药后2周）","quote_sha256":"10c99dea1b0a818522b70098d13975242ac4a1084684b588ce76dbdbb8237f6c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"访视策略：V0筛选（-28~-1d）：病史、查体、ECHO、实验室、NT-proBNP、ECG\nV1随机入组（D0）\nV2（W4）：疗效与安全性评价\nV3（W8）：疗效与安全性评价\nV4治疗结束（W12±3d）：主要终点评价与全面安全性\nV5安全随访（W14）：AE转归确认","quote_sha256":"800eb16ea146eb75477b7e06d79039e3bd9771113065a3435efd6a8add9b994d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_012"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"目标研究人群：年龄段：成人；疾病状态：中重度；经治情况：经治疗效不佳；18-75岁慢性稳定性HFrEF，LVEF≤40%，NYHA II-III级，稳定GDMT≥4周仍症状未控制","quote_sha256":"de61760938b9f9c46038282a1a5a9cce128034b89ed026e2794dc0b3d2eb0588","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_014"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_024"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_025"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_026"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"83a8469236905f60f11fec86f93234f3ddf2027482e82bafa90802a6e138e6e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_027"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:revision:6","quote":"剂量与给药方案：SMOKE-r12-1AD口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC1201）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服；每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整。","quote_sha256":"29600394a5a217ac02bc2bc1ae68a1a1ed79974131e6a9015aa0747970b9dd70","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","span_id":"es_011"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_005","es_004","es_007","es_012","es_014","es_024","es_025","es_026","es_027","es_011"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":9},"gap_items":[],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究总体设计为随机化、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心。研究分为四个阶段：筛选期（第-28天至第-1天）、12周双盲治疗期（第0天随机给药至第12周）、治疗结束访视（第12周±3天）和安全随访期（末次给药后2周）。筛选期完成病史采集、体格检查、超声心动图、实验室检查、NT-proBNP检测和心电图。随机入组访视（第0天）完成随机化分组和首次给药。第4周和第8周访视进行疗效与安全性评价。治疗结束访视（第12周±3天）进行主要终点评价与全面安全性评估。安全随访访视（第14周）确认不良事件转归。目标研究人群为18至75岁慢性稳定性HFrEF成人，LVEF≤40%，NYHA心功能II至III级，筛选前已接受稳定GDMT至少4周仍有症状。试验干预为KZ-sGC1201口服固体制剂（小分子sGC刺激剂），每日晨起随餐口服，系统暴露。","rationale":"总体设计关键词（随机化、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心）来源于章节包当前正文和项目事实中的总体研究设计描述。研究时期、访视策略、目标人群、药物技术类型和给药途径均直接来源于当前项目已确认研究事实。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_4e9f04592c63_2ab9311590ddc0a3","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:05ef1b858d770a033939e939","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_13987acca28e9d3b741e:r6:5d397aeff2202320","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","c